Subject: [PATCH] [PR #65182] Fuse Mamba2 aligned metadata CUDA graph inputs
Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/65182
Upstream-Commit: 14d3984b7118db638a188bc4f20b79c0bacfb232
Integration-Base: c7a760751977e4e3396d586956d8767a9bc44a82
Refresh-Base: 46f36fa294559d080edc61a09e5b57826218a2bf

Bind MRV2 persistent aligned state-index and accepted-token buffers directly
to the Mamba2 metadata builder, retaining the fallback for other runners and
cache modes. Includes upstream graph-input aliasing and padding regressions.
Preserve upstream FlashInfer ReplaySSM initialization and metadata handling.

